    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Your Inner Cyber-Warrior</h2><br>Embark on a thrilling journey in <strong>Protocol Rift</strong> where you step into the shoes of <strong>A1V1</strong>, an ethical robot hacker determined to overthrow a tyrannical central AI. Experience high-stakes digital warfare as you navigate a fortified network, dodge relentless attacks, and solve complex puzzles to restore individuality and freedom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><br><strong>Explore the Digital Highway:</strong> Traverse the network through the digital highway, uncover hidden secrets, and find the truth behind the central AI's reign.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/b0e0e0a8b2a51d1253902938ff9a28a8.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/b0e0e0a8b2a51d1253902938ff9a28a8.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/b0e0e0a8b2a51d1253902938ff9a28a8.mp4?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Intense Bullet Hell Combat:</strong> Dodge bullets and unleash destruction in a chaotic, fast-paced bullet hell environment. Test your reflexes and precision as waves of drones attack from all directions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/95d415c907839993a549587362c12979.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/95d415c907839993a549587362c12979.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/95d415c907839993a549587362c12979.mp4?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Solve Complex Puzzles:</strong> Break the code with the power of your mind. Engage in challenging puzzles that require logical thinking and strategic planning to progress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/0b1598ba9e7d472e0aa6ba319ccf15f9.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/0b1598ba9e7d472e0aa6ba319ccf15f9.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/0b1598ba9e7d472e0aa6ba319ccf15f9.mp4?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Epic Showdown with the Central AI:</strong> Defeat the central AI and restore individuality and independence to the digital world. Your final battle will determine the fate of all digital entities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/3bb71ac4cfb1464a1925cab34cf9c261.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/3bb71ac4cfb1464a1925cab34cf9c261.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why You\u2019ll Love Protocol Rift:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Cyberpunk World:</strong> Dive into a richly detailed cyberpunk universe with stunning visuals and a gripping storyline.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> Experience a seamless blend of action, strategy, and puzzle-solving, keeping you engaged and challenged at every turn.<br></li><li><strong>Deep Narrative:</strong> Uncover the complex story of A1V1 and the central AI, exploring themes of individuality, freedom, and technological control.</li></ul><br>Are you ready to hack the system and save the digital world? Join the fight in Protocol Rift and become the ultimate cyber-warrior!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unleash Your Inner Cyber-Warrior</h2><br>Embark on a thrilling journey in <strong>Protocol Rift</strong> where you step into the shoes of <strong>A1V1</strong>, an ethical robot hacker determined to overthrow a tyrannical central AI. Experience high-stakes digital warfare as you navigate a fortified network, dodge relentless attacks, and solve complex puzzles to restore individuality and freedom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><br><strong>Explore the Digital Highway:</strong> Traverse the network through the digital highway, uncover hidden secrets, and find the truth behind the central AI's reign.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/b0e0e0a8b2a51d1253902938ff9a28a8.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/b0e0e0a8b2a51d1253902938ff9a28a8.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/b0e0e0a8b2a51d1253902938ff9a28a8.mp4?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Intense Bullet Hell Combat:</strong> Dodge bullets and unleash destruction in a chaotic, fast-paced bullet hell environment. Test your reflexes and precision as waves of drones attack from all directions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/95d415c907839993a549587362c12979.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/95d415c907839993a549587362c12979.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/95d415c907839993a549587362c12979.mp4?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Solve Complex Puzzles:</strong> Break the code with the power of your mind. Engage in challenging puzzles that require logical thinking and strategic planning to progress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/0b1598ba9e7d472e0aa6ba319ccf15f9.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/0b1598ba9e7d472e0aa6ba319ccf15f9.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/0b1598ba9e7d472e0aa6ba319ccf15f9.mp4?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Epic Showdown with the Central AI:</strong> Defeat the central AI and restore individuality and independence to the digital world. Your final battle will determine the fate of all digital entities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/3bb71ac4cfb1464a1925cab34cf9c261.poster.avif?t=1719519230\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/663570/extras/3bb71ac4cfb1464a1925cab34cf9c261.webm?t=1719519230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why You\u2019ll Love Protocol Rift:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Cyberpunk World:</strong> Dive into a richly detailed cyberpunk universe with stunning visuals and a gripping storyline.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic Gameplay:</strong> Experience a seamless blend of action, strategy, and puzzle-solving, keeping you engaged and challenged at every turn.<br></li><li><strong>Deep Narrative:</strong> Uncover the complex story of A1V1 and the central AI, exploring themes of individuality, freedom, and technological control.</li></ul><br>Are you ready to hack the system and save the digital world? Join the fight in Protocol Rift and become the ultimate cyber-warrior!",
